- Catalog installed during the run (list or link):

## Structure (automated)

- [ ] Frontmatter has only the allowed fields; name equals the directory
- [ ] Description starts with the trigger and stays within the budget
- [ ] Body is a numbered procedure with acceptance gates, within the line limit
- [ ] Every reference and asset is linked; no link leaves the skill directory
- [ ] Structured templates parse; scripts pass lint and `--self-test`
- [ ] Spelling and Markdown lint pass
- [ ] No credentials, personal data, internal host names or proprietary text

